{"uid":"813d8bac1b56d3e6","name":"test_the_compose_service_matches_each_flags_shipped_default","fullName":"tests.test_deployment_contract#test_the_compose_service_matches_each_flags_shipped_default","historyId":"fe542ccce7b12f83737e83428b3e2215","time":{"start":1792630222077,"stop":1792630222134,"duration":57},"description":"Every flag's compose default must match its ``caliber.config`` default exactly.\n\n    Three of the four unsupported areas ship off, so the stack must not enable them by\n    omission; Aria is the one exception (it ships on), so an operator must be able to turn\n    *it* off from the root ``.env`` the same way the others are turned on. The expected\n    default is read from ``CaliberConfig`` itself rather than hardcoded here, so this test\n    fails the moment compose and the config field disagree, whichever one drifts.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Every flag's compose default must match its <code>caliber.config</code> default exactly.</p>\n<pre><code>Three of the four unsupported areas ship off, so the stack must not enable them by\nomission; Aria is the one exception (it ships on), so an operator must be able to turn\n*it* off from the root ``.env`` the same way the others are turned on. The expected\ndefault is read from ``CaliberConfig`` itself rather than hardcoded here, so this test\nfails the moment compose and the config field disagree, whichever one drifts.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792629378570,"stop":1792629378570,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_dispose_create_app_engines","time":{"start":1792630222074,"stop":1792630222075,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":